# libSceCommonDialog — #34, the native PS5 IME keyboard.
#
# The CommonDialog family (IME, save-data, message, ...) refuses to start until
# sceCommonDialogInitialize() has been called once in the process, and there is
# no libSceCommonDialog.so in the SDK stub set - so this is the only way an app
# module reaches it. libSceImeDialog itself DOES have an SDK stub
# ($PS5_SYSROOT/lib/libSceImeDialog.so) and needs no entry here.
#
# One symbol only: every name in this file becomes an unconditional positional
# import, and a name absent from the firmware's .sprx makes the loader reject
# the whole module (CE-108255-1, no log).
sceCommonDialogInitialize
